{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25584","headline":"题开圣寺 · 李涉","name":"题开圣寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿雨初收草木浓，羣鸦飞散下堂锺。\n长廊无事僧归院，尽日门前独看松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}